      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Kindred can mark targets to Hunt. Successfully completing a Hunt permanently empowers Kindred's basic abilities. Every 4 hunts completed also increases Kindred's basic attack range.",
      "summary_zh": "千珏可以标记敌人进行狩猎。成功完成一次狩猎，将永久强化千珏的基础技能。每完成4次狩猎，还会提升千珏的普攻距离。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307936:3994253"
      ]
    },
