      "summary_en": "Wolf enrages and attacks enemies around him. Lamb passively gains stacks by moving and attacking. When fully charged, Lamb's next attack restores health.",
      "summary_zh": "狼灵狂化并攻击在他附近的敌人。羊灵通过攻击和移动来被动地积攒层数。当层数攒满时，羊灵的下次攻击将治愈生命值。",
