      "summary_en": "Lamb fires a carefully placed shot, slowing the target. If Lamb attacks the target two more times, her third attack instead directs Wolf to pounce on the enemy, savaging them for massive damage.",
      "summary_zh": "羊灵进行一发谨慎的定位射击，来使目标减速。如果羊灵又进行了两次攻击，那么她的第三次攻击会指挥狼灵扑向目标，对目标造成巨量伤害。",
